Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","review_id":"ejVs1QipT9oLv-0y24ZYWA","date":"2014-07-27T23:44:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9357047080993652,"text_excerpt":"After a recommendation from a friend, we tried this bar with a limited menu as a place to hit up for a late lunch. We wanted authentic New Orleans cuisine and I think that we did a pretty good job in finding it. I got the Catfish Po' Boy and my partner got the Jambalaya and everything was on POINT! Our bartender was Polish and every other bartender there seems to be of a different ethnicity. It was cool but at the same time it was a little difficult to understand the whole 'flow' of the joint. Regardless, the food was good and almost all of their beers are imported. Oh, and I forgot to add, this is one of about 6 bars in the French Quarter that serves ABSINTHE. That's right, from anywhere..."},{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","review_id":"S3YmEF0jTzjO_V_acgGc9Q","date":"2015-02-20T05:07:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296656847000122,"text_excerpt":"This place is a nice find. It's off the bourbon street but not far from it. This place is also open at all hours. You can get feed in the middle of the night. It seems as this is the place to go after the bourbon street workers close out. The menu is pretty simple here and surprisingly tasty. Get a cat fish po boy. Can't go wrong with that. It's crispy breaded and fried. Although, i was drunk it still tasted awesome. The barkeep here was also really friendly and was able to hold an interesting conversation."},{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","review_id":"SXTItMFuOqHFzU2yD0EC_w","date":"2014-06-05T01:01:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9275953769683838,"text_excerpt":"My fav place to eat in the quarter. The bartenders are personable. I went back twice so I could try more menu items. Local beer on tap plus many more local bottles too. This is one block off bourbon, open late, and offers wonderful late night snacks. Go where the locals go!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","photo_id":"_b_GR4uBcikmVHEDGoH2fQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_b_GR4uBcikmVHEDGoH2fQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9614614844322205},{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","photo_id":"A9sQkjXp1twLU7DVDpfq0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/A9sQkjXp1twLU7DVDpfq0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9473221302032471},{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","photo_id":"2l01EFzMT_yGHRpIitAqWg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2l01EFzMT_yGHRpIitAqWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9394069314002991},{"business_id":"rQgvzje411OZY2p9fLdycQ","photo_id":"uhcklXMHK0uJYdjgLUlHaw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uhckl